akerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":2378474986,"text":"コソ泥たちめ！お前たちが供え物を奪ったせいで、神様が応えてくれなくなったんだ！","nextNodeIds":[728030202]},{"nodeId":728030202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12085,"speakerName":"とげとげしい宝盗団メンバー","textMapHash":579512370,"text":"供え物？祠に置かれてたもののことか？勘弁してくれ、あんなもんタダでくれたっていらねぇよ！","nextNodeIds":[728030203]},{"nodeId":728030203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12085,"speakerName":"とげとげしい宝盗団メンバー","textMapHash":3192277386,"text":"それに、あんなしょぼい供え物、神が応えてくれるわけねぇだろ！","nextNodeIds":[728030204]},{"nodeId":728030204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":2150985650,"text":"ふ…ふざけるな！しょぼくなんかない！","nextNodeIds":[728030205]},{"nodeId":728030205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12085,"speakerName":"とげとげしい宝盗団メンバー","textMapHash":1736371930,"text":"まあいい、俺はお前らにかまってやる時間なんてないんだ！","nextNodeIds":[728030207]},{"nodeId":728030207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":3653776066,"text":"ぼ…僕が神様に捧げた供え物は、しょぼくなんかない…","nextNodeIds":[728030208]},{"nodeId":728030208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4055956202,"text":"どんな願いを叶えたいか教えてくれる？","nextNodeIds":[728030209]},{"nodeId":728030209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":665445226,"text":"いいよ…もうこんなことになったし、願いも叶えられないだろうから…","nextNodeIds":[728030210]},{"nodeId":728030210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":1066748498,"text":"僕には2つの願いがある、どっちも簡単なものなんだ。1つ目は、今後試験をしなくてもいいこと！試験がなければ、僕も叱られなくなるから。","nextNodeIds":[728030211]},{"nodeId":728030211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":1699155210,"text":"もう1つは…学校で僕をいじめてるやつがやめてくれること…","nextNodeIds":[728030212,728030214]},{"nodeId":728030212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":725186826,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}も試験は嫌い。","nextNodeIds":[728030213]},{"nodeId":728030213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":3124174754,"text":"そうでしょ！試験は本当に嫌いなんだ…でも、あのいじめっ子は試験よりも嫌いだ…","nextNodeIds":[728030216]},{"nodeId":728030216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":3257213306,"text":"彼女は僕が祠で試験したくないって言ってるのを見て、先生に僕の成績を聞きに行ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[728030217]},{"nodeId":728030217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":1510553546,"text":"それ以来彼女はいつもこう言ってくるんだ。神様にお祈りするよりも勉強に時間をかけた方がいい、そんなにしつこくしてると神様もうんざりするって…","nextNodeIds":[728030218]},{"nodeId":728030218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":2942777346,"text":"しかも彼女は、僕が…甲斐性なしだって…","nextNodeIds":[728030219]},{"nodeId":728030219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":693354642,"text":"神様に何でも頼るのは確かによくない。","nextNodeIds":[728030220]},{"nodeId":728030220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":1585884314,"text":"でも大人たちが面倒事に遭遇した時も、祠で供え物を捧げてるよ…","nextNodeIds":[728030221,728030222]},{"nodeId":728030221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2822539298,"text":"それは祈りを捧げてるだけ。","nextNodeIds":[728030223]},{"nodeId":728030223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":2319522370,"text":"うぅ…僕、わからないよ…みんな神様に問題を解決してもらうために、祠に供え物を捧げてるんじゃないの？","nextNodeIds":[728030224]},{"nodeId":728030224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":4048850314,"text":"他の人に聞いてみようよ。","nextNodeIds":[728030225]},{"nodeId":728030225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":1853671786,"text":"うぅ…そっか。でも何がどうあれ、僕の願いはきっと叶えられない…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":728030222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2441385954,"text":"最後は自分で解決しないとだめ。","nextNodeIds":[728030223]},{"nodeId":728030214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","spe