":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3051,"speakerName":"宏一","textMapHash":787037186,"text":"えへへ、僕は大きくなったら外の世界に行ってみたいって神様に頼んだよ。","nextNodeIds":[728030405]},{"nodeId":728030405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3051,"speakerName":"宏一","textMapHash":2106522594,"text":"でも、お祈りをしても、普段きちんと勉強しなきゃだめなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[728030406]},{"nodeId":728030406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3051,"speakerName":"宏一","textMapHash":698964098,"text":"お父さんとお母さんが言ってた。外を旅行したいなら、お金がないとだめなんだって…","nextNodeIds":[728030407]},{"nodeId":728030407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":126924626,"text":"そう、だから神様にお願いすれば、きっとうまくいくよ！","nextNodeIds":[728030408]},{"nodeId":728030408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3051,"speakerName":"宏一","textMapHash":3226515906,"text":"いや、それはちょっと違うよ。だって旅行に行ったら、たとえ稲妻の神様であろうとも外国にいる僕を守れはしないと思う…","nextNodeIds":[728030409]},{"nodeId":728030409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3051,"speakerName":"宏一","textMapHash":2066252642,"text":"親が言うには、神様にお祈りをするのって、安心感を得ることなんだって。願い事を叶えるには、やっぱり自分で努力しなきゃ。","nextNodeIds":[728030410]},{"nodeId":728030410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3051,"speakerName":"宏一","textMapHash":3438346346,"text":"詳しい道理は僕にも分からないけど、もっと知りたいなら、七月姉に聞いてみて。七月姉さんはこういうことに詳しいから。","nextNodeIds":[728030411]},{"nodeId":728030411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3045,"speakerName":"翔太","textMapHash":2108364546,"text":"#うぅ…じゃあ、{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}、七月姉さんのところに行ってみよう…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7280304,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJ